<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | Skill Record</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg-darker); padding: 60px 20px;">

    <div class="auth-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 30px;">About Us</h2>
        
        <div style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
            <p>Welcome to <strong>Skill Record</strong>, the ultimate platform designed to bridge the gap between students, educators, and the professional world.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">Our Mission</strong>
            Our mission is to empower students by providing a comprehensive system to track their internships, manage their daily tasks, and record weekly summaries of their progress. We aim to foster continuous growth and skill development.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">For Students</strong>
            We offer a seamless interface to maintain a digital record of all your professional endeavors. From daily logging to generating final reports of your achievements, Skill Record helps you showcase your real-world experience effectively.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">For Faculty</strong>
            We provide educators and mentors with the tools they need to monitor student progress, review weekly summaries, and provide valuable feedback to ensure every student reaches their full potential.</p>

            <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Join us in building the future of internship tracking and career growth!</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px;">
            <button type="button" class="cta-btn cta-btn-secondary" style="flex: 1;" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Go Back Home</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
